Data license
============

The textual card data in data/cards.json (names, rules text, types, races,
set and rarity information) is derived from the Duel Masters Wiki on Fandom
(https://duelmasters.fandom.com), whose text content is available under the
Creative Commons Attribution-ShareAlike 3.0 license (CC BY-SA 3.0):
https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/3.0/

Changes made: wikitext markup was parsed and cleaned, fields were normalised
into a JSON schema, and cards from several wiki pages were merged.
Individual page histories (authors) are available on each page, linked from
the `url_wiki` field of every card.

This data file is therefore distributed under the same license (CC BY-SA 3.0).

